      "value": "That's incorrect. It's only asking to not index the RSS feed links.\nIf you look up more popular discourse domains, you'll see that they use the exact same robots.txt, and have several pages indexed on Bing.\nhttps://forums.sketchup.com/robots.txt\nBingbot is just slow now days. It was even being throttled by default back in 2017-2018, because it made 10x the requests than other crawlers. Which has since been sorted.\nAdditionally, site owners have crawl controller via their site https://www.bing.com/webmasters/help/crawl-control-55a30303",
